# ==============================================================================
# Platform Match 2.0 — Google Gemini API Free Tier Configuration
# ==============================================================================
#
# HOW TO GET A FREE KEY (NO CREDIT CARD / NO BILLING REQUIRED):
# 1. Visit Google AI Studio: https://aistudio.google.com/
# 2. Sign in with your Google account.
# 3. Click "Get API key" and create a key in a new or existing free project.
# 4. Copy the key and create a file named ".env.local" in this project directory:
#
#    GEMINI_API_KEY="your-api-key-here"
#
# MODEL CONFIGURATION:
# Current active Free Tier models:
# - gemini-3.8-flash (Default recommended high-performance Flash model)
# - gemini-3.5-flash-lite (Lightweight ultra-low latency model)
#
GEMINI_API_KEY=""
GEMINI_MODEL="gemini-3.8-flash"
